    ],
    "explanation": "A template-svc reconciler session opened transaction 99588 on notif-db and left it open holding a row lock on notifications (line 104). Subsequent updates queued behind that lock (lines 115, 117), so template-svc's queries hit their statement timeout and notification-svc's calls to template-svc timed out (lines 111, 112, 126, 127). notification-svc's connection pool to template-svc saturating (lines 134, 139) and the api-gateway 504s (lines 131, 140, 153, 169) are downstream symptoms. The fix is to kill the idle-in-transaction session, not to add capacity.",
    "difficulty": "easy",
    "acceptableCauses": [],
    "herringLines": [],
    "scenario": "dependency_timeout/db-lock-wait"
  }
